{"seq": 8, "missing": [], "found_factual_error": true, "error_note_zh": "团城面积数据在馆方中文站与英文站之间互相矛盾：中文站称「面积约6176平方米」，英文站称「面积4500平方米」，两者均为 Tier1 官方来源但数字不一致（城高4.6米、周长276米两站一致，唯独面积不同），需核实以何者为准。", "top_missing_zh": null, "top_missing_en": null, "error_note_en": "The area data for 团城 conflict between the museum’s Chinese and English websites: the Chinese site states “approximately 6,176 square metres,” while the English site states “4,500 square metres”; both are Tier 1 official sources, but the figures are inconsistent (the two sites agree on the city wall height of 4.6 metres and circumference of 276 metres, with only the area differing), so which figure should be used needs to be verified."}
